+
+- Shared surface: SwiftUI-shaped ButtonStyle/role configuration, AnyLayout stack
+  adapters, builder-based LazyVStack/LazyVGrid, adaptive maximum column width,
+  date Text, vertical TextField, text content types, context menus, image
+  interpolation, environment modifiers and accessibility attributes. Path gains
+  quadratic curves, currentPoint and nonzero winding hit testing; custom Shape
+  bodies default to primary fill. Existing data-based lazy initializers remain.
